From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:35:35 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Physics v2 feel pass: circle-center physics, fixed takeoff
 integration, hill rhythm, spring camera, presets, npm run feel

- bird: the physics state is the circle center (= sprite center); ground rides the offset curve;
  takeoff integrates the rest of the step in the air; exact ballistic step. Removes ground/air chatter
  (v1: 9-16 takeoffs/s on convex upslopes, half-speed crawl before launch) and sprite lurch/snap.
- presets classic/smooth/rush/floaty + diveRamp, airLift, takeoffMargin knobs.
- islands: typed symmetric hills (normal/deep/wide), small jitter, growth along the island.
- camera: critically damped springs for zoom/Y/ground ref, X with velocity feed-forward (stable at any dt).
- tools: npm run feel (chatter/jerk/zoom guards), npm run sim rebaselined to v2 (preset classic).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
